&lt;h2 id="简介"&gt;简介&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2 id="章节列表"&gt;章节列表&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/619e53d5933942aaaede558a58180f10/reader/1" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第1章 将要成为自己道侣的师姐的被辱，尸瘟断肠中凌辱屈辱求生&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/619e53d5933942aaaede558a58180f10/reader/2" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第2章 明明在被追杀，却要在尸体师姐体内“充能”才能活下去吗？&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/619e53d5933942aaaede558a58180f10/reader/3" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第3章 不杀赵坤，先当着护卫的面把他高傲的夫人炼成尸姬母狗吧&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/619e53d5933942aaaede558a58180f10/reader/4" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第4章 母女盖饭达成！利用坏掉的母亲把清纯的大小姐骗进地狱&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/619e53d5933942aaaede558a58180f10/reader/5" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第5章 既然被包围了，那就开个淫乱派对来提升尸姬军团的战斗力吧&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/619e53d5933942aaaede558a58180f10/reader/6" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第6章 最终决战！看着自己的妻女在战场上高潮，赵坤道心破碎&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/619e53d5933942aaaede558a58180f10/reader/7" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第7章 后日谈：虽是尸姬，但这确实是我和她们无可救药的幸福日常&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>我的家人在漫展后被催眠洗脑成为人偶coser了，第五章</title><link>https://v2acg.github.io/novels/kcwkc4cwg4ko0ooc/</link><pubDate>Wed, 04 Mar 2026 02:28:37 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://v2acg.github.io/novels/kcwkc4cwg4ko0ooc/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="本页为收录内容-点击下方按钮跳转查看内容详情"&gt;本页为收录内容 点击下方按钮跳转查看内容详情&lt;/h2&gt;
